#: ../../source/reference/cli/freeports-dev.md:195
msgid ""
"A probe is **one independent file** named `probe_<question>.py`. Put it "
"in a directory and name the directory with `--probes-dir` or "
"`dev.probes_dirs`; it then appears in `probe list`, and if it has the "
"name of a shipped probe it stands in for it — `list` says so."
